class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8984em;"><span style="top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> නියත කෝණික වේගයකින් භ්‍රමණය වේ. නියත ව්‍යාවර්ථයක් <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">10</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> s</span></span></span></span></span></span> තුළ යෙදූ විට තැටියේ කෝණික වේගය <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><msup><mtext> rad s</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20\text{ rad s}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8984em;"></span><span class="mord">20</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> rad s</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8984em;"><span style="top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> දක්වා අඩු වේ. යොදන ලද ව්‍යාවර්ථයේ විශාලත්වය කොපමණ ද?</p>', '<p>ව