">\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> (<span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho &gt; \beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">ρ</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0528em;">β</span></span></span></span></span>) වේ. ගෝලය ජල මතුපිටේ සිට ඉහළ යන උපරිම උස කුමක්ද? (සියලු දුස්ස්‍රාවි බල සහ ජලයේ පෘෂ්ඨික ආතතිය නොසලකා හරින්න.)</p>', NULL, 'ජලය තුළදී ඉහළට ඇති ශුද්ධ ත්වරණය <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>β</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mi>β</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a = \frac{V\rho g - V\beta g}{V\beta} = g\left(\frac{\rho}{\beta} - 1\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><spa