<span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> සහ ආරෝපණ <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q, 2q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0359em;">q</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0359em;">q</span></span></span></span></span> වූ A සහ B ආරෝපිත අංශු දෙකක් ඒකාකාර චුම්බක ක්ෂේත්‍රයකට ලම්බකව අරයයන් පිළිවෙළින් <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r, 2r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0278em;">r</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0278em;">r</span></span></span></span></span> වූ වෘත්තාකාර මාර්ග වල ගමන් කරයි. A සහ B අංශු වල වේග පිළිවෙළින් <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/