<img src="https://api.mehewara.edu.lk/api/v1/media/legacy/supabase-storage/8684eba6-09ec-5802-b6c0-2a682ba32a76.unknown" alt="Screenshot 2026-06-13 085809.png" class="mhw-q-img" />', '<p>AB විභවමාන කම්බියේ දිග <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext> cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">100\\text{ cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">100</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> වන අතර ප්‍රතිරෝධය <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">10Ω</span></span></span></span></span> වේ. එය <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0077em;">R</span></span></span></span></span> ප්‍රතිරෝධයක් සහ අභ්‍යන්තර ප්‍රතිරෝධය නොගිණිය හැකි වි.ගා.බ. <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">V</span></span></span></span></span></span> වූ කෝෂයක් සමග ශ්‍රේණිගතව සම්බන්ධ කොට ඇත. කුඩා <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> mV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10\\text{ mV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">10</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> mV</span></span></span></span></span></span> වි.ගා.බ.යක් සහිත ප්‍රභවයක් සඳහා සංතුලන දිග <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext> cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">40\\text{ cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">40</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> වන බව සොයා ගන්නා ලදී. <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0077em;">R</span></span></span></span></span> හි අගය කොපමණ ද?</p>
