<img src="https://api.mehewara.edu.lk/api/v1/media/legacy/supabase-storage/d59d7d0e-21c6-5528-b865-36224e501f88.unknown" alt="Screenshot 2026-06-13 085833.png" class="mhw-q-img" />', '<p>ට්‍රාන්සිස්ටර පරිපථයක පෙන්වා ඇති ට්‍රාන්සිස්ටරය ක්‍රියාකාරි කලාපයේ ක්‍රියාත්මක වේ. <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{BE} = 0.6\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3283em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.0502em;">B</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.0576em;">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">0.6</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">V</span></span></span></span></span></span> යැයි උපකල්පනය කරන්න. පාදක (Base) වෝල්ටීයතා බෙදුම සඳහා <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext> k</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">50\\text{ k}\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord">50</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> k</span></span><span class="mord">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> ප්‍රතිරෝධක දෙකක් පවතී. විමෝචක (Emitter) ප්‍රතිරෝධකය <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> k</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\\text{ k}\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> k</span></span><span class="mord">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> ද, සංග්‍රාහක (Collector) ප්‍රතිරෝධකය <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> k</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\\text{ k}\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> k</span></span><span class="mord">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> ද, සැපයුම් වෝල්ටීයතාව <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+10\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">+</span><span class="mord">10</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">V</span></span></span></span></span></span> ද වේ. <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{CE}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3283em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.0715em;">C</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.0576em;">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> හි ආසන්න අගය කොපමණද?</p>
<img src="https://api.mehewara.edu.lk/api/v1/media/legacy/supabase-storage/d59d7d0e-21c6-5528-b865-36224e501f88.unknown" alt="Screenshot 2026-06-13 085833.png" class="mhw-q-img" />', NULL, 'පාදක වෝල්ටීයතාව <span class="mhw-eq"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> V</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext> k</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext> k</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext> k</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_B = 10\text{ V} \times \frac{50\text{ k}\Omega}{50\text{ k}\Omega + 50\text{ k}\Omega} = 5\text{ V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3283em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">10</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord"> V</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margi